  abilityId: 840607
  abilityName: World Spike
  abilityDesc: 10 combo Thunder attack on all foes (consecutive uses boost damage),
    greatly boosts BC, HC and item drop rates for 3 turns, probable huge 2 turn Atk,
    Def reduction, fills own BB gauge to max & adds probable random status ailment
    infliction to attack for 3 turns
